<title>USA: Sioux Falls feeder cattle not well tested - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls feeder cattle not well tested - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Not enough of anyone class to test the market, compared to Thursday, USDA said. Small volume, steady. About 70 percent over 600 lbs.</p>
<p>Steers: Medium and Large 1: few 950-1000 lbs 69.20-69.25; 1000-1100 lbs 68.80-70.25.</p>
<p>Heifers: Medium and Large 1: 400-500 lbs 79.50-83.50; 500-550 lbs 77.00-78.25; 550-600 lbs 71.25-73.00; 650-700 lbs 70.25-74.25.</p>
